1039
00:53:26,340 --> 00:53:28,980
We are focusing on digital transformation.

1040
00:53:28,980 --> 00:53:31,860
We aim to strengthen our global presence.

1041
00:53:31,860 --> 00:53:32,780
Let's model.

1042
00:53:32,780 --> 00:53:36,180
Our company is currently undergoing rapid expansion.

1043
00:53:36,180 --> 00:53:39,300
We're investing heavily in technology and innovation.

1044
00:53:39,300 --> 00:53:41,620
Very natural business language.

1045
00:53:41,620 --> 00:53:42,820
What if someone asks,

1046
00:53:42,820 --> 00:53:45,180
